                                                "sense_id": "4811fcec-7eef-32e6-be66-d5a4c658143a",
                                                "text": "Not only that, H K Gruber, the Austrian composer, conductor and self-described chansonnier who was to perform the vocal solo of his own work, “Frankenstein!!,” the major work on the program, never made it."
                                            }
